---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Meghan Lendhe — Product Designer & NeuroHCI Researcher" theme="light">
<!-- Luminous Gallery Atmosphere: Layered Warm Ambient Gradients -->
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[#FAF9F5]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_75%_55%_at_70%_10%,rgba(217,119,6,0.045),transparent_65%)]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_45%_at_15%_25%,rgba(13,148,136,0.035),transparent_60%)]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_55%_40%_at_85%_75%,rgba(217,119,6,0.03),transparent_70%)]"></div>

<!-- Interactive Biological Neural Simulation Canvas (Organic Morphology, Curvilinear Axons, Finite Cascades) -->
<canvas id="synaptic-field" class="absolute top-0 inset-x-0 w-full h-[120vh] pointer-events-none -z-10"></canvas>

<main id="main" class="relative max-w-page mx-auto px-6 md:px-20 pb-72 pt-28 md:pt-40 font-sans text-neutral-800 selection:bg-amber-500/20 selection:text-neutral-900">

    <!-- HERO SECTION: Luminous & Grounded Career Opening -->
    <section id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title" class="relative mb-36 md:mb-52">

      <!-- Monumental Career Motto Headline -->
      <div class="max-w-6xl mb-16">
        <h1 id="hero-title" class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-[6.75rem] font-normal leading-[0.93] tracking-[-0.04em] text-neutral-950 mb-8 text-balance">
          Creating seamless interactions between humans and computers.
        </h1>

        <!-- Intermediate Scale Bridge -->
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-snug tracking-tight mb-14 max-w-[50ch]">
          I'm Meghan Lendhe—a product designer and neuroHCI researcher bridging biosignal computing with human-centered systems.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">
          <div>
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.8] max-w-[52ch] text-pretty">
              I explore how neural interfaces, biosignal decoding, and machine learning can make computing feel natural, adaptive, and human. Currently developing hands-on research experience in zero-calibration EEG decoding architectures while bringing a proven foundation in end-to-end product design.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section Roadmap (Clear, Human, Zero Boxes) -->
          <div class="space-y-6 lg:pt-1">
            <div class="text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-neutral-500">EXPLORE WORK</div>
            <nav aria-label="Page navigation" class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider">
              <a href="#research" class="group flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 pb-2.5 text-neutral-900 transition-luxury hover:text-amber-700 hover:border-amber-500">
                <span>01. NEUROHCI &amp; BIOSIGNALS</span>
                <span class="text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-amber-700 group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-luxury">→</span>
              </a>
              <a href="#product-design" class="group flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 pb-2.5 text-neutral-600 transition-luxury hover:text-neutral-950 hover:border-neutral-400">
                <span>02. PRODUCT DESIGN CASE STUDIES</span>
                <span class="text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-950 group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-luxury">→</span>
              </a>
              <a href="#about" class="group flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 pb-2.5 text-neutral-500 transition-luxury hover:text-neutral-950 hover:border-neutral-400">
                <span>03. PERSPECTIVE &amp; COLLABORATION</span>
                <span class="text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-neutral-950 group-hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-luxury">↓</span>
              </a>
            </nav>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- SECTION 01: NEUROHCI & BIOSIGNAL COMPUTING -->
    <section id="research" aria-labelledby="monograph-title" class="mb-48 md:mb-56 scroll-mt-32">
      
      <!-- Section Tag -->
      <div class="pb-5 mb-16 border-b border-neutral-200">
        <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase">
          01 / NEUROHCI &amp; BIOSIGNAL COMPUTING
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Asymmetric Broadsheet Layout (65/35 Split with Technical Ledger) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] gap-16 lg:gap-24 mb-20 items-start">
        <div>
          <h2 id="monograph-title" class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.5rem] text-neutral-950 leading-[1.02] tracking-tight mb-8 text-balance">
            Zero-Calibration BCI: Classifying Neural Patterns Across Unfamiliar Sessions
          </h2>
          <div class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed max-w-[44ch] mb-10">
            “Standard BCI setups require 30 minutes of calibration before decoding a single thought. If neural interfaces are ever going to be practical outside a lab, zero calibration is a non-negotiable step.”
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-600 font-light text-lg leading-[1.85] max-w-[54ch]">
            <p class="text-neutral-900 font-normal text-xl leading-relaxed">
              In non-invasive Brain-Computer Interfaces, user adoption breaks at the calibration step. Traditional motor-imagery systems require 20 to 40 minutes of repetitive calibration at the start of every session before any control is granted. Sensor displacement, daily impedance changes, and non-stationary neural signals cause models trained yesterday to fail today.
            </p>
            <p class="text-neutral-600">
              For the NeurIPS 2026 Brain &amp; Body Workshop Challenge, I explored training neural decoding architectures to classify raw EEG patterns into 3 continuous motor tasks <span class="text-neutral-950 font-normal underline decoration-neutral-300 underline-offset-4">without pre-session calibration</span>. By projecting differing subjects and recording sessions into an invariant latent manifold, this approach isolates motor intent from non-stationary noise from the very first second.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Specification Ledger -->
        <div class="space-y-8 lg:pt-4 pl-0 lg:pl-10">
          <div class="text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500">EXPERIENCE &amp; TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS</div>
          
          <dl class="space-y-6 text-xs font-mono">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-400 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">CALIBRATION LATENCY</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium tabular-nums">0.0 sec Pre-Session</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Instantaneous inference upon sensor placement</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-400 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">ELECTRODE MONTAGE</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">10-20 Sensorimotor Strip</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Motor cortex coordinates: C3, Cz, C4</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-400 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">INVARIANCE STRATEGY</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">Latent Manifold Alignment</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Mitigates cross-subject neural drift</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-400 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">TASK CLASSIFICATION</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">3-Class Continuous</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Left Hand · Right Hand · Baseline Rest</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-neutral-200">
            <a
              href="https://neural-interfaces26.github.io/index.html"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700 hover:text-amber-700 transition-luxury group"
            >
              <span class="tracking-wider">NEURIPS WORKSHOP CHALLENGE REPO</span>
              <span class="text-amber-600 font-mono transition-luxury group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Methodological Breakdown -->
      <div class="pt-14 border-t border-neutral-200 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">PIPELINE 01 / SIGNAL PREPROCESSING</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-950">Uncalibrated 10-20 Montage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Streaming multi-channel microvolt fluctuations across motor cortex coordinates (C3, Cz, C4) without baseline sweeps or manual impedance matching.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">PIPELINE 02 / LATENT ALIGNMENT</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-950">Session-Invariant Geometry</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Projecting non-overlapping recording days and cross-subject neural variance into a shared latent space, decoupling motor intent from hardware noise.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">PIPELINE 03 / INTENT DISCRIMINATION</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-neutral-950">Continuous 3-Class Inference</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Distinguishing between left motor imagery, right motor imagery, and cognitive rest immediately upon donning the sensor array.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PERSPECTIVE INTERLUDE (Clean & Minimal) -->
    <section id="about" aria-label="Perspective" class="py-20 md:py-28 my-16 border-y border-neutral-200 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.35em] text-amber-700 uppercase">PERSPECTIVE</span>
        <blockquote class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-900 font-light leading-[1.3] text-balance">
          “The most impactful technology doesn’t demand that people adapt to it. It adapts quietly to them.”
        </blockquote>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-400 uppercase pt-2">
          MEGHAN LENDHE · PRODUCT DESIGN &amp; NEUROHCI RESEARCH
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- SECTION 02: PRODUCT DESIGN & COMPLEX WORKFLOWS -->
    <section id="product-design" aria-labelledby="product-title" class="pt-16">
      
      <div class="pb-5 mb-16 border-b border-neutral-200">
        <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase">
          02 / PRODUCT DESIGN &amp; COMPLEX WORKFLOWS
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mb-24">
        <h2 id="product-title" class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-neutral-950 mb-6">
          Product Design
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.7] max-w-[52ch]">
          I spent the past few years designing digital products across e-commerce, government services, and healthcare.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CASE STUDY SPREADS: Authentic Domain & Impact -->
      <div class="space-y-44">
        
        <!-- Case Study 01: BulkMagic -->
        <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] gap-16 items-start group">
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/80">
            <a href="/bulkmagic" class="block aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden">
              <img
                src="/assets/experience/bulkmagic-group-buy.jpg"
                alt="BulkMagic campus group-buying e-commerce product architecture"
                class="w-full h-full object-contain p-4 grayscale contrast-110 opacity-90 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-[1.015] transition-luxury duration-700"
              />
            </a>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase border-t border-neutral-200 px-4 py-2.5 bg-neutral-50/80">
              <span>E-COMMERCE · GROUP BUYING</span>
              <span>UHUNGRY PILOT</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 lg:pt-2">
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block">E-COMMERCE · CAMPUS PILOT</span>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
              BulkMagic: Campus Subscription Ecosystem
            </h3>
            <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.7]">
              Pivoted BulkMagic into a focused campus subscription pilot with UHungry Cafe at the University of Utah. Architected responsive prototypes, mapped group-buy state machines, and tested student meal-plan economics.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-3">
